{"id":"5934","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5934_main_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-and-cumulus-fractus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>巨大、圆形的融合团块和卷轴排列成大范围云层可确定其为层积云。它在日出时极厚，并在早晨逐渐抬升变薄。午后，仅剩薄的层积云块。</p>\n<p>抬升变薄是由于随着东南方向的庞大高压向南后退，低云层从稳定转变为条件不稳定。</p>\n<p>随着云的抬升和稳定性的改变，积云开始形成。在层积云下面可看到一些破碎的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，塔斯马尼亚州，尼尔森山","latitude":"纬度: 42° 55' 27'' S","longitude":"经度: 147° 20' 39'' E","date":"15 August 2011 1139 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 8, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.7.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.7.1"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5934_syn_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-and-cumulus-fractus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>东南方向的高压系统向南移动，后面是快速抵近的冷锋。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2011，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5934_upper_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-and-cumulus-fractus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>在1200米处的轻逆温正在变弱并抬升。在之后的12小时逆温侵蚀。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5934_sat_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-and-cumulus-fractus_clouds.jpeg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>这是EUMETSAT卫星4号通道红外图像。在澳大利亚塔斯马尼亚州尼尔森山以东的近海可看到大范围的层积云层。层积云中的破裂处也十分明显。锋前云带正从西北方向快速抵近。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2011","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/6063_main_stratus-viewed-from-above_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>从香港的最高峰大帽山（957米）俯瞰，可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层云</span>。层云的上表面通常有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波浪</span>（通常是短波长），而且有时有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">凸起</span>。在强风下，波浪更加明显。</p>\n<p>在照片的顶部是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>层。云的大范围特征可确定为成层云种。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">圆形的大云团</span>很蔽光，可遮住太阳（蔽光云类）；然而，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">可看到从云素之间的间隙透过的光线</span>，这也表明是漏隙云类。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">阴暗浅蓝色的条纹和光束呈曙暮辉的形式</span>。</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Francis So","location":"俯瞰层云","latitude":"纬度: 22° 24' 32'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 8' 16'' E","date":"07 February 2014 0804 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.8.0","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.8.0"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4476_main_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>照片的右半部分显示了一片波状的层积云；其波状特征在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">位置1</span><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">和2</span>处尤为明显。该云层在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">位置3</span>-<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>处的边缘异常陡峭且呈锯齿状。</p>\n<p>该照片拍摄于一次锢囚锋过境约12小时后；当时格陵兰中部正有一个弱反气旋在发展。</p></div>","copyright":"© G. Rouillon","location":"Greenland (70 : 55 N, 40 : 38 W)","latitude":"纬度: 71° 42' 25'' N","longitude":"经度: 42° 36' 15'' W","date":"17 July 1951 0200 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 5, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}